190	 * Same guarded synchronous posture as captureProjectGuidance — turn acceptance
191	 * is synchronous, so the async profile reader cannot be used here. A missing
192	 * file is silent; any unsafe or unreadable state returns an advisory so the
193	 * turn still runs with the file visibly ignored, never silently emptied. */
